sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as HTTP Client
    participant E as Inbound HTTP Endpoint
    participant R as Router
    participant A as Remote Handler Adapter
    participant RM as Remote Microlith
    C ->> E: POST /events (target = remote capability)
    Note over E,R: Process Inbound Event
    E ->> R: handle(Event)
    Note over R: Route Inbound Event
    R ->> A: Forward Event to Remote Capability
    alt remote microlith available
        Note over A: Convert Event to wire format
        A ->> RM: HTTP POST /events
        RM -->> A: 2xx response
        Note over A: Convert wire format to Event
        A -->> R: Event
    else remote returns HTTP error
        A ->> RM: HTTP POST /events
        RM -->> A: 4xx/5xx response
        A -->> R: EventHandlingException
    else network failure
        A ->> RM: HTTP POST /events
        RM -->> A: connection failure
        A -->> R: EventHandlingException (interrupt flag restored if interrupted)
    end
    R -->> E: Event
    E -->> C: HTTP response
    Note over A,RM: Code: HttpEventHandlerAdapter, RemoteHandlerLoader, RemoteCapability
    Note over A,RM: Tests: HttpEventHandlerAdapterTest, RemoteHandlerLoaderTest, SyncForwardingEventHandlerTest
